and [[unnamed Suit 033|033]] responded to an explosion set off by Dante. As the last one to respond, he heard [[Lok Lambert]] and was led away by him. Following the investigation, he and a team of Suits caught up to Dante's team in the Tomb of Nefertiti. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}","text":"This Suit was sent by Klaus, under the instructions of Rassimov, to go after Dante Vale in County Kerry, Ireland. His team of Suits ambushed Scarlet Byrne and Dante's team in the New Grange Passage Tomb but were eventually defeated. [Home Turf]\n\nHe later was sent to Valley of the Kings, Egypt, where he and unnamed Suits 026, 030, and 033 responded to an explosion set off by Dante. As the last one to respond, he heard Lok Lambert and was led away by him. Following the investigation, he and a team of Suits caught up to Dante's team in the Tomb of Nefertiti. [The Sceptre Deception]"},{"heading":"Abilities","level":2,"wikitext":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}","text":"Like most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans."},{"heading":"Spells Utilized","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Blasteater]]\n* [[Raypulse]]\n\n{{col-2}}","text":"• Augerfrost\n• Blasteater\n• Raypulse"},{"heading":"Bonded Titans","level":3,"wikitext":"* [[Bonelasher]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","text":"• Bonelasher"}],"full_text":"Unnamed Suit 028 is a Suit within the Organization. He operates from Vienna, Austria, under Klaus.\n\nHistory\n\nThis Suit was sent by Klaus, under the instructions of Rassimov, to go after Dante Vale in County Kerry, Ireland. His team of Suits ambushed Scarlet Byrne and Dante's team in the New Grange Passage Tomb but were eventually defeated. [Home Turf]\n\nHe later was sent to Valley of the Kings, Egypt, where he and unnamed Suits 026, 030, and 033 responded to an explosion set off by Dante. As the last one to respond, he heard Lok Lambert and was led away by him. Following the investigation, he and a team of Suits caught up to Dante's team in the Tomb of Nefertiti. [The Sceptre Deception]\n\nAbilities\n\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization Titans.\n\nSpells Utilized\n\n• Augerfrost\n• Blasteater\n• Raypulse\n\nBonded Titans\n\n• Bonelasher","raw_wikitext":"{{infobox character\n| image     = File:Unnamed Suit 028.png\n| aliases   = \n| relations = \n| base      = [[Vienna, Austria]]\n| group     = [[The Organization]] {{Icon|ORG}}<br> [[Suits]]\n| first     = \"[[Home Turf]]\"\n| last      = \n| gender    = Male\n| hair      = Blonde\n| eyes      = \n| va        = \n}}\n'''Unnamed Suit 028''' is a [[Suit]] within [[the Organization]]. He operates from  [[Vienna, Austria]], under [[Klaus]].\n\n== History ==\nThis Suit was sent by [[Klaus]], under the instructions of [[Rassimov]], to go after [[Dante Vale]] in [[County Kerry, Ireland]]. His team of Suits ambushed [[Scarlet Byrne]] and Dante's team in the [[New Grange Passage Tomb]] but were eventually defeated. {{source|Home Turf}}\n\nHe later was sent to [[Valley of the Kings, Egypt]], where he and [[unnamed Suit 026|unnamed Suits 026]], [[unnamed Suit 030|030]], and [[unnamed Suit 033|033]] responded to an explosion set off by Dante. As the last one to respond, he heard [[Lok Lambert]] and was led away by him. Following the investigation, he and a team of Suits caught up to Dante's team in the Tomb of Nefertiti. {{source|The Sceptre Deception}}\n\n== Abilities ==\nLike most Suits, he was issued with the standard Organization [[Titans]].\n\n{{col-begin}}\n{{col-2}}\n=== Spells Utilized ===\n* [[Augerfrost]]\n* [[Blasteater]]\n* [[Raypulse]]\n\n{{col-2}}\n=== Bonded Titans ===\n* [[Bonelasher]]\n\n{{col-end}}\n[[Category:Seekers]]\n[[Category:Organization members]]\n[[Category:Suits]]","categories":["Characters","Organization members","Seekers","Suits"],"links":[{"target_id":"huntik:page:8234","status":"resolved","target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"The Organization","label":"The Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/The_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suits","label":"Suits","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suits","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3228","status":"resolved","target_title":"Home Turf","label":"Home Turf","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Home_Turf","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3228"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2050","status":"resolved","target_title":"Suit","label":"Suit","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Suit","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2050"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:1990","status":"resolved","target_title":"the Organization","label":"the Organization","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/the_Organization","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A1990"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:8234","status":"resolved","target_title":"Vienna, Austria","label":"Vienna, Austria","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Vienna%2C_Austria","href":"#/categories?name=Vienna%2C%20Austria"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3241","status":"resolved","target_title":"Klaus","label":"Klaus","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3241"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:3241","status":"resolved","target_title":"Klaus","label":"Klaus","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Klaus","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A3241"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2090","status":"resolved","target_title":"Rassimov","label":"Rassimov","target_url":"https://huntik.fandom.com/wiki/Rassimov","href":"#/entry/huntik%3Apage%3A2090"},{"target_id":"huntik:page:2006","status":"resolved","tar